= Report Outline

#guide[
  *ABE Guideline:* Provide a first description of the final report — for example, a preliminary table of contents.

  *Tip:* This doesn't need to be final, but it should show that you have thought through the thesis structure. A classic ABE thesis structure might look like:

  + Introduction
  + Literature Review / Background
  + Materials and Methods
  + Results
  + Discussion
  + Conclusions and Recommendations
  + References
  + Appendices

  Adjust to fit your project. For example, if you have two distinct experimental phases, you might split Results into two chapters, each with its own methods sub-section.
]

#guide[
  _Replace this block with your preliminary table of contents. You can use a numbered list or a simple outline._
